Package: 1bit-lemonade
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: 1bit <packages@1bit.gg>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libssl3t64 | libssl3, zlib1g, libzstd1,
 libcurl4t64 | libcurl4, libwebsockets19t64 | libwebsockets19, libcap2, libsystemd0,
 libdrm-amdgpu1, libbrotli1
Conflicts: lemonade-server
Replaces: lemonade-server
Provides: lemonade-server
Description: our build of Lemonade Server
 1bit OS, Lemonade Server appliance: lemond, the lemonade CLI and
 the web app, built from the 1bit fork (the onebit recipe, the three
 Qwen3 NPU catalog entries, the drop-in that points onebit at
 /opt/1bit). This is our fork, not the upstream lemonade-server
 package, and it conflicts with it.
